  index_gallery.html, index_all.html, index_search.html and index_spa.html all
  pull from site.data.visualizations / visualization_categories / recent_pages,
  and _includes/category-pager.html is fully dynamic. So regenerating the data
  files is what updates them. I verified the one hand-maintained list
  (index_todo.html) still points at 20 files that all exist, so nothing there is
  stale.

